# Canonical identities, so `git shortlog -sne` and GitHub's contributor
# graph agree with reality. Several people committed under two spellings of
# their own name or from two addresses (a local git config on one machine,
# GitHub's noreply address on another), which splits one person into two
# rows and undercounts them.
#
# Left of the angle brackets is the canonical name; entries after it are the
# variants being folded in.

